        ],
        "tags": [
          "Core/Admin"
        ],
        "summary": "List all school settings",
        "description": "Get list of all school settings organized by category.\n\nUsed for \"Filter Setting Group\" dropdown showing:\n- ALL\n- School Features (ON/OFF)\n- Automatic Notifications\n- Director Settings\n- Admin Settings\n- Accounts Settings\n- Enquiry Settings\n- App Settings\n- Student Certificates\n- HR Payroll Settings\n- Teacher App Features\n",
        "operationId": "listSchoolSettings",
